                                "sense_id": "7e51c80d-9672-356d-b1e6-a002453fe2ac",
                                "text": "bycause Sir Palomydes beganne fyrste, and never he wente nor rode oute of the fylde to repose hym, but ever he was doynge on horsebak othir on foote, and lengest durynge, Kynge Arthure and all the kynges gaff Sir Palomydes the honoure and the gre as for that day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7efac30c-ff4d-41c4-a9e0-114a934f16e1",
                                "sense_id": "7e51c80d-9672-356d-b1e6-a002453fe2ac",
                                "text": "And thenne the kynge lete blowe to lodgynge\nand by cause sir Palomydes beganne fyrste\nand neuer he went nor rode oute of the feld to repose\nbut euer was doynge merueyllously wel outher on foote or on horsbak\nand lengest durynge Kynge Arthur and alle the kynges gaf sir Palomydes the honour and the gree as for that daye"
                            }
                        ]
